# GenAI Chatbot (Streamlit + OpenAI)

A web-based AI chatbot built using Python, Streamlit, and OpenAI API.
This project demonstrates how to integrate Large Language Models (LLMs) into a real-time interactive application.

---

##  Features

* Interactive chatbot UI (Streamlit)
* Powered by OpenAI GPT model
* Secure API key management using `.env`
* Chat history with session memory
* Real-time responses

---

## Tech Stack

* Python
* Streamlit
* OpenAI API
* python-dotenv

---

## Demo

Run locally:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

---

## Project Structure

```
genai-project/
│── app.py          # Streamlit UI chatbot
│── chatbot.py      # CLI version
│── .env            # API key (not pushed)
│── .gitignore      # ignored files
│── README.md       # project documentation
```

---

## Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/genai-chatbot.git
cd genai-chatbot
```

2. Create virtual environment:

```bash
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows
```

3. Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

4. Add your OpenAI API key in `.env`:

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here
```

5. Run the app:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

